<div class="page-wrap admin-page"><div class="eyebrow">SITE ADMINISTRATION</div><div class="page-heading"><h1>网站管理平台</h1><p>管理课程作业、公告与学习资料，查看网站发布状态。</p></div>
<section class="admin-gate"><h2>管理员身份验证</h2><p id="admin-status" role="status">正在检查登录状态…</p><button class="button" id="admin-login">使用 GitHub 管理员账号授权</button><a class="text-link" href="/account/">个人中心 →</a><p class="muted">管理操作仅限本站管理员。发布时使用管理员的 GitHub 授权，公开课堂记录仍保存在课程仓库。</p></section>
<div id="admin-error" class="account-error" hidden role="alert"></div>
<div id="admin-workspace" hidden><nav class="admin-tabs" aria-label="管理模块"><button data-admin-tab="publish" aria-selected="true">发布作业 / 公告</button><button data-admin-tab="records" aria-selected="false">已发布记录</button><button data-admin-tab="content" aria-selected="false">课程内容维护</button><button data-admin-tab="deploy" aria-selected="false">发布状态与维护</button></nav>
<section class="admin-panel" data-admin-panel="publish"><h2 id="publish-heading">发布新内容</h2><form id="admin-publish-form"><div class="form-grid"><label class="form-field"><span>内容类型</span><select name="kind"><option value="assignment">课程作业</option><option value="announcement">课程公告</option></select></label><label class="form-field"><span>课程练习模板（可选）</span><select id="admin-template"><option value="">手动填写</option><% learning().lessons.forEach(l=>{ %><option value="<%= l.id %>">第 <%= String(l.id).padStart(2,'0') %> 讲 · <%= l.title %></option><% }) %></select></label></div><label class="form-field"><span>标题</span><input name="title" maxlength="100" required></label><label class="form-field"><span>正文（支持 GitHub Markdown 与 TeX 公式）</span><textarea name="body" rows="12" maxlength="20000" required></textarea></label><label class="form-field" id="record-state-field" hidden><span>状态</span><select name="state"><option value="open">进行中 / 已发布</option><option value="closed">已结束</option></select></label><div class="admin-actions"><button class="button" type="submit">检查发布内容</button><button class="button secondary" type="button" id="new-record">清空并新建</button></div></form><div id="publish-review" class="admin-review" hidden><h3>发布前核对</h3><strong id="review-title"></strong><pre id="review-body"></pre><button class="button" id="confirm-publish">确认发布到公开课堂</button><p id="publish-result" role="status"></p></div></section>
<section class="admin-panel" data-admin-panel="records" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2>已发布记录</h2><button class="button secondary" id="reload-admin-records">刷新</button></div><div id="admin-records"></div></section>
<section class="admin-panel" data-admin-panel="content" hidden><h2>课程内容维护</h2><p class="muted">选择课程或参考页面，编辑 Markdown 和 TeX。保存后自动运行 Hexo 并更新网站；发布前会检查公式与构建结果。</p><label class="form-field"><span>页面</span><select id="admin-content-path"><option value="">正在读取页面目录…</option></select></label><div class="admin-actions"><button class="button secondary" id="load-content">载入当前版本</button><span id="content-version" class="muted"></span></div><label class="form-field"><span>页面源文件</span><textarea class="admin-editor" id="admin-content-editor" rows="24" spellcheck="false" disabled></textarea></label><div class="admin-actions"><button class="button" id="save-content" disabled>保存并发布更新</button><a class="text-link" id="content-live-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/courses/">查看线上页面 ↗</a></div><p id="content-save-status" role="status"></p><p class="muted">保留文件开头的页面信息和原有 raw 标记。独立公式使用 \[ … \]，行内公式使用 \( … \)。代码块请标注 bash、openfoam、cpp 或 python。</p></section>
<section class="admin-panel" data-admin-panel="deploy" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2>发布状态与维护</h2><button class="button secondary" id="reload-deployments">刷新状态</button></div><div id="admin-deployments"></div><div class="quick-links"><a href="/maintenance/">网站维护手册 →</a><a href="https://github.com/MrLittleShark/mrlittleshark.github.io/tree/foamlab-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">网站源文件 ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/MrLittleShark/mrlittleshark.github.io/actions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">构建日志 ↗</a><a href="https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/nmkforbzmbstasnjxlid" target="_blank" rel="noopener">认证与数据库 ↗</a></div></section>
</div></div><script src="/assets/admin.js" defer></script>
